    "diagnosis": "Pituicytoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This 55-year-old man presented with symptoms identical to those of a non-functioning pituitary adenoma, and his preoperative neuroimaging studies were similarly thought to be non-functioning pituitary adenoma based on the presence of a homogeneous, well-demarcated sellar/suprasellar mass, as seen here. However, biopsy proved this to be a pituicytoma.",
