    "diagnosis": "Pituicytoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Diffuse nuclear immunoreactivity for thyroid transcription factor&nbsp;1 (TTF1) is typical of pituicytoma and confidently distinguishes it from schwannoma, meningioma, or pituitary adenoma&nbsp;/ pituitary neuroendocrine tumour (PitNET), all of which are TTF1-immunonegative.",
